{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"民數記","commonName":"民數記","title":"民數記","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"85178673aa1b8f4f59166e042dd1f8eca3a7c3393527850eb9a97150672c5b13","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1267},"chapter":{"number":17,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["亞倫的杖"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對摩西說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你要吩咐以色列人從每個支派的首領那裡拿一根杖來，共十二根，你要在上面寫上他們各人的名字。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["你要把亞倫的名字寫在利未支派的杖上，每個支派的首領都要有一根杖。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["你要把這些杖放在會幕內的約櫃前，就是我跟你會面的地方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["誰的杖發芽，誰就是我所揀選的人。這樣，我必消除以色列人對你們的埋怨。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["於是，摩西吩咐以色列每個支派的首領把杖都交給他，共十二根，亞倫的杖也在其中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["摩西把杖放在放約櫃的聖幕裡、耶和華面前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["第二天，摩西進入約櫃所在的聖幕裡，看見利未支派亞倫的杖不單發了芽，長了花蕾，還開了花，結出熟杏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["摩西就從耶和華面前拿出所有的杖，給以色列人看。他們看後，各位首領便取回自己的杖。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶和華對摩西說：「把亞倫的杖放回約櫃前，讓叛逆之徒引以為戒。這樣，你就可以平息他們對我的怨言，使他們不致滅亡。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["摩西照耶和華的吩咐行了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["以色列人對摩西說：「完了！我們死定了！我們全死定了！"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["凡走近耶和華聖幕的都要死。我們全都要滅亡嗎？」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/17.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/18.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/16.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}